Tab Objects
Tab Objects
Assign resources to the LockoutZone on the tab Objects.
Remarks
A resource is any of the built-in Material Flow Objects, or a Frame in which you modeled a machine,
whose Working hours you would like to control with the LockoutZone. In addition, you can also add a
Worker or the WorkerPool.
You can manipulate the contents of the list window with the commands of the Context Menu of
Embedded Lists.
